{
  "id": "1CH.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 15",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nihidu giibaleakta sandakwajeanda neajeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwadeeksa geaw Dawdi gealga aba mujiineeda Dawdi; ak gwasin heechea goobiida sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA, ak ghamiinda maheemajeanda jea ghwayiin jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi Dawdi, “Manda siida jea ghwaat sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA geaghus fuga Lawi, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ghwaloat saawa ghwasar sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA nea gagadiiyeesa niny galeaga sean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabwada geat Dawdi buuneesean bea Israeli aba Yerusalemu, gooscheeng'u sandakwajeanda neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea ghoahiita heeda ghayi sin jea goobiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwada geat Dawdi orjooga Haruni, ea gea Lawi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea orjooga Gohati; nea Urieli ea siida haweewa saawa, sea buweadeagaaschi was fih bughala ea diktam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea orjooga Merari; nea Asaya ea siida haweewa saawa, sea buweadeagaaschi was fih bughalaji iyeenya ea diktam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea orjooga Gershoni; nea Yoeli ea siida haweewa saawa, sea buweadeagaaschi was fih bughala ea diktam ea damanamughuush; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea orjooga Elisafani; nea Shemaya ea siida haweewa saawa, sea buweadeagaaschi was fih bughalaji iyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea orjooga Hebroni; nea Elieli ea siida haweewa saawa, sea buweadeagaaschi was fih seedam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea orjooga Usieli; nea Aminadaabu ea siida haweewa saawa, sea buweadeagaaschi was fih bughala ea damaniyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa Dawdi Sadoki ea Abiyatari was ashoohoodiga, ea fuga Lawi, Urieli, ea Asaya, ea Yoeli, ea Shemaya, ea Elieli sea Aminadaabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha, “Agooga goowooschi fuga hees bea dooshta ghweanigeagwa bea Lawi; oamiini geat, agooga ea buweadeegeagwa, ak gooscheeng'u sandakwajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, ea ghwahita heeda easinyi jea goobiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba mii ayeanni aba mwadi, damanda bwaraneasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, aba gideaba meesindani gida rukuteayda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoamiidu geat ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak abeeda gweadu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweadu orjooga Lawi sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA aba hamarjoojiga nyaawa aba badayda geediga, gawuurji gidarukuteayda Musa, gawuurji sea ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Dawdi fuga hees bea Lawi, gaguursa buweadeega nyaawa sarmani, sea dabita nyaawa bara bundiida, ea ginandajeega, ea gidoondoorajeega, ea gureayeeka, ak ghabwar nea goojuur muuchi nea gahoosan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguursa fuga Lawi Hemani orjeeda Yoeli; ea gea buweacheandaanyi was Asafu orjeeda Berekiya; ea gea orjooga Merari was buweadeega nyaawa ea Etani was orjeeda Gishi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwandeayi sea saawa was buweadeega nyaawa basiinyi, Sakariya gil, ea Shemiramoti, ea Yehieli, ea Uni, ea Eliyabu, ea Benaya, ea Maaseya, ea Matitiya, ea Elifelehu, ea Mikneya sea fuga dooshta Obed-edomu sea Yeieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga sarmani ea, Hemani, ea Asafu, sea Etai, geeyeesha abwara gureayeekeagwa sisna lagheanga oomng'i nea ghoanung' goojuur; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sakariya, ea Ya-asieli, ea Shemiramoti, ea Yehieli, ea Uni, ea Eliyabu, ea Maaseya, ea Benaya, gwandeawa ginandajeega ajuuri nyeariida dea Alamoti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Matitiya, ea Elifelehu, ea Mikneya, ea Obed-edomu, ea Yeieli, ea Asasiya, mideawa gidoondoorajeega ajuuri nyeariida dea Sheminiti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Genaniya, was siida haw bea Lawi ambal fuga sarmani, gayghoadoabiiw sarmeeda, aba gideaba hirgheacheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Berekiya ea Elikana ea fuga fura dooshta mida sandakwajeanda neajeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Shebaniya, ea Yoshafati, ea Netaneli, ea Amasayi, ea Sakariya, ea Benaya, ea Elieseri was ashoohoodiga, ghaghuut durumbeati aba madeeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA; nea Obed-edomu ea Yehiya ea furiischoodiga sandakwajeanda neajeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibaleakta sandakwajeanda neajeeda ea ghwahita Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Dawdi sea gweargwa Israeli, ea fuga mida madeeda fuga nyiit sagalamnyoojiga, gaweay gooscheeng'u sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gheeh Obed-edomu nea gahoosan muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gabareasa ASEETA fuga Lawi sar sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, gwanuus duuh ispwa, ea lagweendi ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Dawdi niikwa hang'da gul ng'eanyi sisin muuchi, nea fuga sarmani, sea Genaniya was siida haweewa fuga sareeshi, ea fuga sarmani; abeeda Dawdi gookwa hang'da miy siikwealiisa hamarjoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gidascheeng'deayda buuneesean bea Israeli sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA nea gahoosani nea ghaghuut durumbeatajeega, ea fooriida, ea aba gureayeeka, nea ghwanung' goojuur ginandajeega ea gidoondoorajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean damanda hina sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi, ghoang'weardaawa seawadeeda Mikali was hudeaba Sawli siguura Mikali, ak ghwadaah sugoocheanda was Dawdi, nea ghang'was aba hooseaneega; ak gafool aba jeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
